C     COMMON FOR TRANSLATION OF USER NODES AND BRANCHS TO THE INTERNAL
C     VALUES FOR THESE BRANCHES.  ONLY USED DURING PROCESSING OF
C     INPUT.  THUS DO NOT PUT COMMON BLOCK IN SAVE.  IT SHOULD BE
C     RELEASED FROM STORAGE WHEN SUBROUTINE INFO IS LEFT.

      COMMON/USINTP/ USBRIN, USENIN

      INTEGER USBRIN(9999), USENIN(-9999:19998)

C
